{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/2971e2e531ca5622ab238f83700d9d740f1c32f17b463e98bd8df2fd4f045ce7a022e163fa2ab5ba0b228e5046e76dc4365bbe9144667b03b68f492c36ee3025","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/GGN_aHRjm3nyPAq7fX-dA49eCsclBdPCd_H7yBU-kNcvmIpUXOxAGxdMCtm9JDZMiSOvV8qOzBOe1DwKdtEgwtkddx6s-qKOTbHfBanNtbyQ1osmJso","width":600},"name":"Victor Tsaran","title":"Senior Technical Program Manager, Material Design"},"document_id":5850646594715648,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>自 2011 年起，每年 5 月 19 日，世界各地的组织和个人都会庆祝全球无障碍关注日（GAAD）。这一年度活动展示并弘扬了互联网无障碍以及残障人士包容的重要性。</p>\n<p>引自 <a href=\"https://gaad.foundation\">GAAD 基金会</a>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>每一位用户都理应在网络上获得一流的数字体验。残障人士必须能够与无残障人士一样，成功地体验基于网络的服务、内容和其他数字产品。这种意识以及对包容的承诺，正是全球无障碍关注日（GAAD）的目标——这项全球性活动旨在让人们关注残障人士的数字访问与包容。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>为庆祝这一天，Material Design 博客团队收集了若干文章，聚焦无障碍、以人为本的设计、可读性、本地化等主题。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://m3.material.io/foundations/accessible-design/overview\"><em>Material Design 3 中的无障碍</em></a><br />了解贯穿 Material 各项指南的无障碍标准的起点</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/m3-a11y\"><em>为所有人设计</em></a><br />Material Design 最新的无障碍、颜色与组件亮相 I/O</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/science-of-color-design\">颜色与设计的科学</a></em><br />Material 如何运用色彩科学，让设计比以往更轻松、更具表现力</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/designing-text-visual-acuity-research\">为阅读文本的人设计文本</a></em><br />视觉敏锐度、易读性与文本字号背后的科学</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/inclusive-imagery-at-google\">调整焦点</a></em><br />包容性图像如何让产品从为部分人而做，变为为所有人而做</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/3441852.3471222\">各花入各眼</a></em><br />针对残障人士虚构形象的图像描述中的多层次解读</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/localization-principles-techniques\">高效本地化的原则与技巧</a></em><br />超越翻译本身，打造更具包容性的体验</li>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/readability-research\">按场景调整 grade</a></em><br />衡量字体 grade 对文本可读性的影响</li>\n<li><em>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://blog.google/outreach-initiatives/accessibility/preserving-endangered-languages-noto-fonts/\">用 Noto 字体保护濒危语言</a></em><br />来自 Google Fonts 的开源 Noto 字体家族，为数百种语言提供读写支持</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://material.io/blog/readability-consortium\"><em>携手改进阅读研究</em></a><br />Google 联合赞助 The Readability Consortium——一项聚焦如何利用字体定制阅读体验的协作研究计划</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.google/outreach-initiatives/accessibility/how-accessible-design-helps-everyone/\"><em>无障碍设计如何惠及每个人</em></a><br />Material Design 在更新与落实无障碍指南过程中学到的几条重要经验</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Material Design 团队一直在努力成为无障碍设计与字体领域的引领者，并承诺将继续为此努力。</p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2022","hero":{"a11y_description":null,"bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/fe2469ae8ad80b7a8ad8101b62a93c0e4da557f2991a6d9bee7cfd019e87f95121ff38812492b34eb3a6e09a2821f78193dfe2f3e991b35fc62da3b58dbd7ed5","height":3200,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/eoKmKp829QKJsoDdR1uOZLCwjdORHBwAyeIqXdE32B26ZHcYBYzA9dpgqwUDuUT1sX3gMNM9ayAxySiMh7v6Jd6OS20wtlgz6tiiMuHahuSxy2NvQg","width":2400}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"a11y news","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"来自 Material Design 的资源，助你为所有人设计","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/e34838fdfce1fe1c7571ce6514cca708870ee95a2985c23610db18fd9bb3341ddb296ed566bdf7c514301ab64cd0b4c40fa35087081347a745fd1b9d39ee2dca","height":3200,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OTTVJWGV3sb0k5SgGSNyps-F-SmglW4PiqQVesq_491k6A9BI19c-TluEzLPsKR-iYoZegCRn9xT439biHydmrOBFyH1sTs2uvilytgPsew5u16B1SY","width":2400},"share_title":"Celebrating Global Accessibility Awareness Day"},"published_date":"2022-05-19T13:00:00","slug":"accessibility-awareness-day-2022","subtitle":"来自 Mate